:::

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(lizard,
       aes(x = distance,
           y = pushup)) +
  geom_point(size = 3,
             shape = 21) +
  scale_y_continuous(limits = c(0, 1),
                     breaks = c(0, 1)) +
