## fitting model and looking at diagnostics


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
bat_mod <- glm(recaptured_yn ~ temp * disease_load,
               data = bats_clean,
               family = "binomial")

plot(
  simulateResiduals(bat_mod)
)
```

